  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Election Coordinators via UNDP/PACEC - PACEC Secondment for 5UNV&apos;s Regional Coordnator</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionala valsamordnare via UNDP/PACEC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen innefattar finansiellt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r fem (5) FN-experter till UNDP under en 12-m&#xe5;naders period. Experterna ska arbeta som regionala samordnare i valprocessen i DR Kongo. De ing&#xe5;r som en del i ett st&#xf6;rre program som hanteras av UNDP f&#xf6;r valst&#xf6;d, Projet d&apos;Appui au Cycle Electoral au Congo 2015-2017 (PACEC). Experterna kommer att vara placerade i fem olika provinser och utg&#xf6;r en del av ett team p&#xe5; hittills &#xe5;tta experter. De ska bidra till koordinering och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrat genomf&#xf6;rande av den p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende uppdateringen av valr&#xf6;stl&#xe4;ngden, samt &#xf6;vervaka att s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l denna uppdatering som ett kommande val genomf&#xf6;rs p&#xe5; rimligt s&#xe4;tt. De ska arbeta n&#xe4;ra den nationella valkommissionen (CENI), vilka &#xe4;ven &#xe4;r den fr&#xe4;msta samarbetspartnern f&#xf6;r UNDP under PACEC programmet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution entails support to regional election coordination in DRC during May 2017-April 2018 via UNDPs program - PACEC (Projet d&apos;Appui au Cycle Electoral au Congo 2015-2017). The support will be present in 5 different provinces and is part of a larger regional election coordination support. It shall contribute to improved coordination and the carrying out of the up-dating of the voters registration, and contribute to that the registration is carried out in a reasonable manner. The contribution will also support the election process, once such is initiated. The projekct will closely relate to the national election Commission (CENI), who is also the main beneficiary of the UNDP/PACEC program.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the secondment is to support the government of DRC in organising transparent and peaceful election and pacific transfer of power via election.</narrative>
  </description>
